irst evening:• Plant a few crops and wander the valley at golden hour• Cook with Magali (try the corn soup)• Say hello to Lucinda in the barn• Build a room onto the barn if you feel like settling inSolo is the whole game. You can also invite up to 3 friends into the same valley.Most people spend about 1–3 hours in the demo. The full game is plan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T18:05:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262705294","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5074340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5074340":"2026-10-26T07:59:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5074340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:51Z"},"5179180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:51Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5074340","app_id":5074340,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:23Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b8df1196289de37bc1791e6076f2c5add32169c2b24677746693e3feaead4b32","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Cluckopia는 블록으로 집을 짓는 게임입니다. 당신은 수탉: 집(벽, 문, 지붕)을 짓고 사라진 여동생을 찾아 나섭니다. 심고, 요리하고, 대장질하고, 마을을 꾸미고, 자신의 속도로 친구가 되세요. 위험이 닥치면 전설의 힘을 깨우세요. 혼자 하거나 친구 최대 3명과 함께 플레이하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Andre Luiz Themistocles"}],"developers":[{"name